Changelog & And later additions
V1.7.5 Added Quadruplet (or called four otherwise) star system, Zelda, will have no exoplanets at first, also added Veylon, a rogue neptune sized planet, will have rings later.
1.8.0 (done!) : Visual Enhancing & more Day cycles and improved day cycles.
V1.8.5 (working on) : Ice giant orbiting one of Zeldas star, with moons.
V1.9.0 (later) : 1 new star system and a nebula.
V1.9.5 (later) Quasar eating a A-type star, with a hot jupiter circumbinarily orbiting around them.
V2.0.0 (Later) : Dwarf galaxy, with small black hole, and total visual enhancing.
V2.0.5 (Later): Dysnomer, another moon of Eucalyptus, it has lots of volcanoes (visually), and a 150 km thick atmosphere, it is mercury sized, and has gravity of 4.253 m/s2, plus, orbits farther than Dupe, eccentricity of 0.093.
Kaptura, a captured moon of Eucalyptus, it is half of mercury sized, and is icy, it also has geysers, orbiting farther than Dysnomer with e of 0.123.
V2.1.0 (later) : Roshan, will be farther than Thalasso, a F5V type star, it has the following orbiting it:
Rin, Venus sized, it is red, and has a 150 km thick atmosphere, density of venuses, and a giant crater, Isatope, although rin orbits in the habitable zone, it seems to be not habitable.
Rauli, 0.05x venuses size, it has a earth like atmosphere that is 120 km high, and a debris disk, it has a deep chasmata, Niveus, and lots of craters, and Rauli has water, although now it is mostly snow and ice, orbits slightly farther than Rin, Raulis moon is
Loki, it is europa sized, has a 130 km high atmosphere, and has oceans, mostly smooth terrain.
Borealis, Uranus sized, it is a Hot jupiter, and size of 0.95% of jupiter, it is particularly dark.
V2.2.0 (later) : Magnetar-Pulsar binary, and neutron star orbiting it farther away.
V2.2.5 (later) : Kregg, a red hypergiant, orbiting farther than Roshan, it is binary with Larg, a yellow-white dwarf.
V2.3.0 (later, last) : To the kregg system, added, a retrograde orbiting comet, pill shaped, 20 km big.
